      "locator": "para 1, joint press release",
      "quote": "Sivers Semiconductors AB (STO: SIVE), O-Net Technologies, and Enablence Technologies Inc. (TSXV: ENA) announced a strategic partnership to develop an advanced external light source (ELS) module with Sivers laser arrays supporting Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) deployment in AI datacenters and HPC systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "enablence_sivers_onet_els_2026_s2",
      "locator": "para 2, joint press release",
      "quote": "O-Net Technologies serves as ODM partner, integrating Sivers Semiconductors' laser arrays and Enablence's NxN Star Coupler to deliver a scalable ELS module for scale-out and scale-up optical systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "enablence_sivers_onet_els_2026_s3",
      "locator": "Todd Haugen, CEO, Enablence — direct quote",
      "quote": "Our NxN Star Coupler enables efficient wavelength distribution at scale for CPO-based architectures."
    }
